# Dialogs and forms

## Scroll lock

Every modal calls `useDialogLock` from `src/hooks/useDialogLock.ts` while it is open. Pass `active` when the modal can stay mounted while closed.

```tsx
useDialogLock(open);
```

## Enter submits

Every action in a modal or form submits on Enter: the primary action runs from the form `onSubmit`, and the control is `type="submit"`.

## Esc closes

Anything that can close closes on Esc: modals, dialogs, and inline forms. Esc runs the same close handler as the cancel control.
